<ArticleLayout title="Compare child savings account types" description="A purpose-first comparison of Trump Accounts, 529 plans, UGMA/UTMA custodial accounts, Custodial Roth IRAs, and ABLE accounts." verifiedAt="2026-10-10" sourceIds={['TREASURY-TD-10056','SEC-529-INTRO','FINRA-CUSTODIAL','IRS-IRA-LIMITS','IRS-ABLE-OVERVIEW']} effective="Comparison reviewed October 10; Trump Account rules reviewed October 8, 2026" contents={[
